        <message/>
        <message_html><![CDATA[<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="baseline" border="" hspace="" vspace="" /></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"> <em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em></a></p>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><strong>Please do not reply to this email. This system cannot receive messages.</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Reminder: Action required concerning a workplace incident</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">An incident of type Employee Workplace Incident Reporting has been reported by ${subject_person}<br /><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">on ${opened_at}</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">Location of the incident: ${location.name}, ${location.street}</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">First aid required: ${inc_first_aid_req}</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">OHS has been notified.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">Click ${URI_REF} to proceed in the incident investigation process.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">${mail_script:hoc_remainder_text_en}</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">For any inquires or questions pertaining to this incident, please contact OHS at <a style="color: #0563c1; text-decoration: underline;" href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;">Thank you,</span></p>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><strong><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Occupational Health and Safety&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">House of Commons</span></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8</span><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">th</span><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto"> floor&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</span>&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="none">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</span></a>&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Office: 613- 995-3614</span>&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Rappel : Action requise concernant un incident de travail</span></p>
<div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Merci de ne pas r&eacute;pondre &agrave;&nbsp;ce courriel. Ce syst&egrave;me ne peut recevoir de messages.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Un incident de type Rapport d'incident sur le lieu de travail des employ&eacute;s a &eacute;t&eacute; signal&eacute; par ${subject_person} le ${opened_at}</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Lieu de l'incident : ${location.name}, ${location.street}</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Premiers soins requis : ${inc_first_aid_req}</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">L'OHS a &eacute;t&eacute; avis&eacute;.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Cliquez sur ${URI_REF} pour poursuivre le processus d'enqu&ecirc;te sur l'incident.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">${mail_script:hoc_remainder_text_fr}</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="auto">Pour toute demande ou question concernant cet incident, veuillez contacter le SST &agrave;&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span xml:lang="FR-CA" data-contrast="none"><span data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</span></span></a><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Merci,</span></p>
<div>
<div>
<p><strong><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</span> </strong></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Chambre des communes </span>&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">50 rue O&rsquo;Connor, 8</span><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">e&nbsp;</span><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">&eacute;tage</span>&nbsp;</span><br /><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</span>&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="none">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</span></a>&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span style="font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: 8pt;"><span xml:lang="EN-CA" data-contrast="auto">Office: 613- 995-3614</span>&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>]]></message_html>
